# --- Datasets: NEVER commit (see CLAUDE_CODE_BRIEF.md §2) ---
# All acquired/curated/quarantined data is gitignored. Keep only the directory
# skeleton (.gitkeep) and any small, deliberately-committed sample episodes.
/data/**
!/data/
!/data/.gitkeep
!/data/**/
!/data/**/.gitkeep

